 "applies_to": "Cooper Lighting Solutions Greengate lighting control panel profile 6464643200 (64 relays, 64 switch inputs, 64 remote points), connected over IP to a ProtoNode FPC-N34 gateway.",
 "summary": "A ProtoNode FPC-N34 reads a Greengate lighting relay panel over IP and presents it as a BACnet IP or BACnet MS/TP device. The 6464643200 profile has 64 relays, 64 switch inputs, 64 remote points, plus a panel reset. Relays and remote points are Binary Values; switch input states are Binary Inputs. Cooper marks this guide as discontinued (watermark dated 13-10-2023), so the list is for existing Greengate installations.",
 "bacnet_transport": [
  "BACnet IP",
  "BACnet MS/TP"
 ],
 "firmware": null,
 "default_device_instance": null,
 "access_inferred": true,
 "notes": [
  "From Appendix B.6, 6464643200 Greengate mappings (guide pages 53-57). The point count matches the guide's table of 225 points for this panel.",
  "The table gives only name, object type and instance. Access is inferred: BV relay, remote and reset points are treated as writable, BI and AI as read-only.",
  "The guide pages carry a \"Discontinued 13-10-2023\" watermark; this list is for existing installations."
 ],
 "source": {
  "title": "ProtoNode FPC-N34 and FPC-N35 Startup Guide for Cooper Lighting Solutions Greengate and iLUMIN",
  "doc_number": null,
  "revision_date": "Document Revision 1.H, Template Revision 53",
